    "title": "Earn Money: Get Paid Get Cash",
    "description": "Earn Money: Get Paid Get Cash\r\n\r\nCan you hear it?! \ud83d\ude33\r\n\r\nWhat is that sound?! \ud83d\ude28\r\n\r\nAhh. It is the sweet cash money falling into your PayPal account! \ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\ude1c\r\n\r\nOh yes, Earn Money and get paid real cash rewards on your phone. \ud83d\udcb8\ud83e\udd29\r\n\r\nKa-ching! It is your time to shine. It is your time to Make Money online! \ud83c\udfe6\ud83e\udd73\r\n\r\nEarn Money on your phone and Get Paid doing the things you already do. Get Cash for playing games or do paid surveys. With the earn money app, everyone can earn and get cash rewards! Your make money earning app is here for you to get paid directly to your PayPal account. What are you waiting for? \r\n\r\nEarn Money is here for your financial freedom. You decide which cash rewards you go for today. Paid Surveys? Making money playing games? Earn money testing products? Get paid today? Maybe take a day off and get cash tomorrow? Going overtime to make some extra cash? With Earn Money you are the boss. You are in charge. You take the lead. You make money. \r\n\r\nEarn money on the couch \ud83e\udd17\r\nEarn money in bed \ud83d\ude05\r\nEarn money in the kitchen \ud83d\ude43\r\nEarn money on the toilet \ud83d\ude09\r\nEarn money in the park \ud83e\udd20\r\nEarn money while at work \ud83d\ude07\r\nEarn money everywhere you go \ud83e\udd73\r\n\r\nThe best thing about Earn Money?\r\nEveryone can make money and get cash rewards. All you need it a smartphone and internet connection. Start your paid surveys. Launch your reward games. Test your new products. Get credits in the app, collect points, request payout and get paid. Get cash directly on your PayPal. \r\n\r\nHow does Earn Money work?\r\nGet Earn Money: Get Paid Get Cash. \r\nOpen the make money app to get cash rewards. \r\nCollect the credits points in the app to get cash.\r\nFinish your cash rewards task to make money.  \r\nDecide on the money amount to cash out.\r\nRequest your PayPal money payout directly to your account.\r\nReceive the money and continue playing on your earning app.",
